value.og_desc:
Wine has a huge history throughout the years. From farming to cultivation, harvesting to processing this is a very long but rewarding process. It is a culture for many communities. So it is no wonder that many people are passionate about what it has to offer. That is why there is now so much of an interest in learning how to make wine from a beginner to expert level. There are various factors that should be considering while presenting a wine to a customer. Packaging and presentation is one of them.

That is why we prepared a white wine bottle to display your brand. This will not a be typical supermarket shelf but it is in nature, in a place where the grapes grow! The packaging and branding is fully editable. You just open the layer in a new tab and place your image. Then, press ctrl/cmd + S and it will show up in the mock up!

Email us for designing commissioned, customized creatives for your project or company.

What’s inside?

 	3 high-resolution PSD files;
 	white wine display and mockup;
 	fully editable bottle labels;
 	transparent bottles;
 	realistic paper texture;
 	5760 px x 3240 px (72 ppi);
 	read me file.

*The label design in the preview is not included

